WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:15.322
It took a few weeks for the family to adjust to homeschooling for Beth and Amy.

2
00:00:15.323 --> 00:00:18.975
Mother, Meg, and Jo all taught different subjects.

3
00:00:18.976 --> 00:00:27.281
With Beth, it was fairly easy, since they would each assign her a portion to study for the week, and she could do it at her leisure.

4
00:00:27.282 --> 00:00:31.928
Being an obedient and grateful girl, Beth never neglected her lessons,

5
00:00:31.929 --> 00:00:37.407
making sure she finished all the work first before she allowed time for herself.

6
00:00:37.408 --> 00:00:45.912
Even going to Mr. Laurence's every day, as well as playing on her own little piano, did not distract her from carrying on with her studies.

7
00:00:45.913 --> 00:00:50.978
Amy, on the other hand, found out that she was not as disciplined as her sister.

8
00:00:50.979 --> 00:00:53.319
"Oh, Beth, can we please take a break?

9
00:00:53.320 --> 00:00:58.955
I'm exhausted!" she cried one afternoon as she struggled with a math problem.

10
00:00:58.956 --> 00:01:08.458
"We just had a break, Amy, and besides, Jo wants us to finish this today," said Beth, pointing to the books stacked on the dining table.

11
00:01:08.459 --> 00:01:16.082
Since Beth and Amy were studying together, Mother felt it best to set aside a certain period of time each day for the girls' lessons.

12
00:01:16.083 --> 00:01:24.915
Both Meg and Jo came home around the same time, so they took turns teaching the younger girls for a few hours every afternoon.

13
00:01:24.916 --> 00:01:30.059
Three times a week, Mother stayed home in the morning to help the girls with other subjects,

14
00:01:30.060 --> 00:01:36.524
and on the days that Mother went out for her volunteer work, Beth and Amy were given homework to do.

15
00:01:36.525 --> 00:01:40.707
"I hope Jo never becomes a real teacher," complained Amy.

16
00:01:40.708 --> 00:01:43.561
"I would pity her students if she did.

17
00:01:43.562 --> 00:01:49.427
Just look at how much she gives us to do! How can I possibly read all that?"

18
00:01:49.428 --> 00:01:54.692
Amy spread her hand toward the books and dramatically flung her pencil down.

19
00:01:54.693 --> 00:02:03.326
"Well, if you would stop wasting time complaining and actually start reading, then maybe you could finish your assignment by the time you're 20,"

20
00:02:03.327 --> 00:02:11.727
joked Jo as she came into the room carrying more thick textbooks, which she threw on the table.

21
00:02:11.728 --> 00:02:18.945
"Jo!" shrieked Amy. "What is that? Don't tell me we have to do more math problems?"

22
00:02:18.946 --> 00:02:25.879
"You don't have to do all of them tonight," Jo reassured her sister, who let out a sigh of relief.

23
00:02:25.880 --> 00:02:31.850
Then Jo immediately added, "Some of this is for tomorrow night, since we won't be here."

24
00:02:31.851 --> 00:02:34.910
Amy sat up straight and narrowed her eyes.

25
00:02:34.911 --> 00:02:41.224
"Why not? Where are you going? Is Meg going with you?" she questioned.

26
00:02:41.225 --> 00:02:48.436
Chuckling to herself, Jo flapped a hand at her and said, "It's none of your business.

27
00:02:48.437 --> 00:02:51.831
Now have you solved that problem yet or not?"

28
00:02:51.832 --> 00:02:56.978
Just then Meg rushed in, her cheeks flushed and eyes bright with excitement.

29
00:02:56.979 --> 00:03:00.291
She secretly whispered something in Jo's ear.

30
00:03:00.292 --> 00:03:05.712
Giggling and speaking in hushed tones, the two girls left the room swiftly.

31
00:03:05.713 --> 00:03:09.811
"That's not nice! You shouldn't whisper in front of others!"

32
00:03:09.812 --> 00:03:18.029
Amy yelled after them. Frustrated, hungry, and cranky, Amy vowed to find out what her sisters were up to.

33
00:03:18.030 --> 00:03:21.421
The March sisters rarely kept secrets from each other.

34
00:03:21.422 --> 00:03:26.026
No wonder Amy found it odd that her sisters would not share their news with her.

35
00:03:26.027 --> 00:03:29.683
She had no choice but to find out on her own.

36
00:03:29.684 --> 00:03:36.236
The next afternoon, both Meg and Jo disappeared into their room as soon as they returned from work.

37
00:03:36.237 --> 00:03:44.030
Amy could hear a great deal of running around, closet doors opening and shutting, and worst of all, lots of laughter.

38
00:03:44.031 --> 00:03:52.590
Feeling particularly grumpy that day, Amy left Beth to figure out the math equation, and crept upstairs to her sisters' room.

39
00:03:52.591 --> 00:03:56.122
Luckily for her, the door was slightly open.

40
00:03:56.123 --> 00:03:59.962
"Jo, can you help me with my hair?" Meg was saying.

41
00:03:59.963 --> 00:04:09.995
"As soon as I tie this big Christmas ribbon around my waist," Jo replied, struggling with a satin sash that wound around her dark purple dress.

42
00:04:09.996 --> 00:04:16.449
Giggling, Meg helped her clumsy sister, creating a perfect bow at the back of her dress.

43
00:04:16.450 --> 00:04:20.606
"There, that's better," she laughed cheerfully.

44
00:04:20.607 --> 00:04:24.972
Then through the mirror, she caught sight of an uninvited guest.

45
00:04:24.973 --> 00:04:28.890
"I think we have a visitor," she remarked to Jo.

46
00:04:28.891 --> 00:04:32.448
Jo swung around and caught Amy peering through the door.

47
00:04:32.449 --> 00:04:38.413
"What are you doing? And why aren't you downstairs doing your lessons?" she barked.

48
00:04:38.414 --> 00:04:43.721
Amy stubbornly cocked her head and replied nastily, "Where are you going?

49
00:04:43.722 --> 00:04:48.133
Does Mother know? If she doesn't, I'm going to tell."

50
00:04:48.134 --> 00:04:52.348
Jo pinched Amy hard on her arm causing her to squeal like a pig.

51
00:04:52.349 --> 00:04:56.969
"You nasty little worm! I told you to mind your own business!

52
00:04:56.970 --> 00:05:04.758
As for whether or not Mother knows, do you think we'd sneak around behind Mother's back without getting her permission to go out?" Jo shouted.

53
00:05:04.759 --> 00:05:10.759
"You hurt me! My arm is bruised!" moaned Amy, rubbing the red spot on her arm.

54
00:05:10.760 --> 00:05:16.906
"Serves you right!" said Jo sternly. "Now go downstairs and do your lessons!"

55
00:05:16.907 --> 00:05:20.494
"Just tell me where you're going then," cried Amy.

56
00:05:20.495 --> 00:05:25.167
"Jo, why don't we just tell her?" Meg said, trying to make peace.

57
00:05:25.168 --> 00:05:28.663
"Fine, but don't start crying because you can't come!"

58
00:05:28.664 --> 00:05:31.648
Jo turned her back and continued to get ready.

59
00:05:31.649 --> 00:05:38.477
Meg gently rubbed Amy's arm and began in her motherly way, "Laurie has invited us to―"

60
00:05:38.478 --> 00:05:42.604
But before she could finish, Amy interrupted by screaming,

61
00:05:42.605 --> 00:05:46.761
"You're going to the theater! You're going to see that play!

62
00:05:46.762 --> 00:05:50.700
I wanted to see it! I'm the one who told you about it!"

63
00:05:50.701 --> 00:05:58.033
Neither Meg nor Jo could deny it, for it was indeed Amy who had mentioned the very theater production a few weeks ago.

64
00:05:58.034 --> 00:06:01.346
She had heard about it from her friend Kitty.

65
00:06:01.347 --> 00:06:07.467
"Well, darling, Laurie already saw it and he didn't think it was suitable for young ones . . ."

66
00:06:07.468 --> 00:06:11.013
Meg tried to reason with her frantic sister.

67
00:06:11.014 --> 00:06:19.419
"That's not fair! I want to go! Please, I'm very mature for my age!" Amy continued to argue.

68
00:06:19.420 --> 00:06:23.767
"Well, I know you are, but, well, maybe if we ask . . ."

69
00:06:23.768 --> 00:06:27.622
Meg struggled to find the right words to say.

70
00:06:27.623 --> 00:06:31.873
"No!" Jo slammed the closet door and stamped her feet.

71
00:06:31.874 --> 00:06:37.827
"No, no, no! You are not coming with us because you are not invited!

72
00:06:37.828 --> 00:06:44.046
If you're as mature as you say you are, stop screaming like a monkey, and get back to your lessons!"

73
00:06:44.047 --> 00:06:51.567
"I hate you, Jo March! I hate you!" Amy screamed at the top of her lungs.

74
00:06:51.568 --> 00:06:56.254
"You're going to pay for this! I swear you're going to be sorry!"

75
00:06:56.255 --> 00:07:02.198
Amy collapsed on the floor, wailing and throwing her fists around in frustration.

76
00:07:02.199 --> 00:07:10.835
Jo, grabbing her bag, stepped right over her, and when she got to the door, turned around one last time and said in a spiteful voice,

77
00:07:10.836 --> 00:07:14.154
"You'd better not be in here when we get back.

78
00:07:14.155 --> 00:07:19.093
And you'd better have finished the work I gave you or else you're in big trouble, young lady!"

79
00:07:19.094 --> 00:07:25.548
Meg, looking apologetically at her youngest sister, quietly followed Jo out of the room.

80
00:07:25.549 --> 00:07:33.181
"I promise you will pay for this, Josephine March," sniffed Amy.
